cily/ISic003420",{"ana":44},{"layout":238},{"p":239,"rs":240,"damage":241},"The beginning of two lines of monumental letters are preserved on the stone. A substantial left margin is preserved at the start of each line. Unless the lines below were substantially further indented, there was no text below; the preserved vacat above line 1 (90mm)  is significantly greater than that between lines 1 and 2 (57mm), so it is unclear if another line originally stood above (the top of the stone appears intact) - if it did, it was either significantly above the preserved first line and/or indented several letters to the right.",{"_":48,"ana":49,"ref":50},{"ana":242},"#text_condition.incomplete",{"lettering":244,"dimensions":245},"Deep, very regular, v-cut letters, with a broad v-cut, hair-line extensions to wedge serifs, and a quite wide square module. The I in line one is extended.",[246,250,253],{"type":56,"l":247,"from":58,"to":58,"h":248,"unit":61,"atLeast":249,"atMost":249},"Line 1","68 (I = 87)","68",{"type":56,"l":251,"from":67,"to":67,"h":252,"unit":61,"atLeast":252,"atMost":252},"Line 2","58",{"type":65,"l":66,"from":58,"to":67,"h":254,"unit":61,"atLeast":254,"atMost":254},"57",{"_":256,"notBefore":176,"notAfter":72,"evidence":257},"First or second century","lettering",[259,261],{"_":75,"type":76,"ref":77,"corresp":260,"region":78},"#findspot",{"_":80,"type":81,"ref":82,"region":78},[263],[85,86],[],{"_":266,"role":91,"ref":267},"Teatro Romano di Catania","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/017",{"_":269,"mainLang":270,"languages":271},"Latin","la",[269],{"n":101,"url":273,"height":274,"width":275,"desc":276,"surfaceType":106},"ISic003420_tiled.tif","4080px","3072px","I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-03-19",[278,280,282],{"atLeast":279,"atMost":279},68,{"atLeast":281,"atMost":281},58,{"atLeast":283,"atMost":283},57,[11